  "note": "Election of the Newtownards Borough Council, polled 15 January 1923. The local weekly reported one contest only, in Scrabo Ward (four candidates for three seats); the other four wards were uncontested. 507 out of 750 electors exercised the franchise. Messrs. M'Cutcheon and Mayne were old members of the council."
